{'symbol': 'PCG', 'date': '2020-11-09 13:00:00', 'title': 'PG&E AND THE PG&E CORPORATION FOUNDATION ANNOUNCE THE AWARDING OF STEM SCHOLARSHIPS FOR 2020', 'text': "SAN FRANCISCO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--ON THE HEELS OF NATIONAL STEM/STEAM DAY, PACIFIC GAS AND ELECTRIC COMPANY (PG&E) AND THE PG&E CORPORATION FOUNDATION (THE FOUNDATION) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT 150 STEM SCHOLARSHIPS TOTALING $500,000 ARE BEING AWARDED TO DESERVING STUDENTS. RECIPIENTS INCLUDE A DIVERSE GROUP OF COLLEGE-BOUND HIGH SCHOOLERS, AND CURRENT COLLEGE AND CONTINUING EDUCATION STUDENTS IN NORTHERN AND CENTRAL CALIFORNIA. SCHOLARSHIPS ARE FUNDED THROUGH PG&E'S EMPLOYEE RESOURCE GROU"}